      "writtenOn": "2023-10-04T01:48:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider adding mitigations for race conditions:\n1. Can the user manipulate the settings toggle multiple times?\n1. Even if there are UI locks preventing multiple manipulations of the settings toggle, can this code pathway be triggered through other means (for example, modifying the settings value from adb)?\n\nI think trying the call `UpdateEngine#applyPayload()` will probably fail on the second concurrent call, it may be good to still consider guarding against something like this.\n\n(Maybe this is already done upstream, but I wasn\u0027t able to find this)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 129,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "0255cb028d698244215347026ff0d5a05df30655",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
