      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T02:44:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UI will block until the current update is applied.\nThere are two cls which I am following up.\n1. I will be publishing this update info to SystemUpdaterService when update is successful from update engine and retrieving pending update info before applying a update. b/302391134\n2. UI will be changed to show blocking progress bar till applyPayload is in progress. CL : https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/apps/Settings/+/2766345.\n\nI think these two things should be able to prevent the UI spam. I can also prompt user that there is update pending if they try to spam the dev option.",
      "parentUuid": "102afe8c_c2e14179",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 129,
        "endChar": 74
      },
